Operating segments are defined as components of an enterprise for which discrete financial information is available that is evaluated regularly by the Chief Operating Decision Maker CODM in deciding how to allocate resources and in assessing performance. The Groups chief operating decision maker is the Managing Director and Chief Executive Officer. &lt;br /&gt; 
 &lt;br /&gt; 
The operating segments comprises of &lt;br /&gt; 
 &lt;br /&gt; 
Food delivery offer on demand food delivery services through a network of restaurant partners and delivery partners which is available through mobile application and or website.  &lt;br /&gt; 
Out of home consumption offers restaurant dining solutions that we provide through DineOut and access to curated outdoor events through Scenes.  &lt;br /&gt; 
